{'symbol': 'CAH', 'date': '2023-03-06 09:03:00', 'title': "CARDINAL HEALTH'S OUTCOMES™ COLLABORATES WITH SIGNIFY HEALTH TO OFFER IN-HOME MEDICATION THERAPY MANAGEMENT", 'text': 'DUBLIN, OHIO , MARCH 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CARDINAL HEALTH \xa0(NYSE:CAH) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS COLLABORATION WITH SIGNIFY HEALTH (NYSE:SGFY) TO OFFER IN-HOME CLINICAL AND MEDICATION MANAGEMENT SERVICES THROUGH ITS OUTCOMES™ BUSINESS. THIS COLLABORATION WILL HELP REDUCE COSTS AND ELIMINATE GAPS IN CARE FOR MORE THAN 2.3 MILLION MEMBERS NATIONWIDE TO SUPPORT THEIR TREATMENT JOURNEY FROM PRESCRIPTION TO PHARMACY TO HOME.'}